# GEO-Ready Audit Tool Environment Configuration

# 1. Gemini API Key (Required for Phase 2, 3, and 4 qualitative assessments: e.g. answer-first, fluff, standalone sentences)
# Obtain from Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Google Custom Search API (Required for Phase 5 off-site consensus checking)
# Obtain API Key: https://developers.google.com/custom-search/v1/introduction
# Create a Custom Search Engine (CX) and get the Search Engine ID: https://programmablesearchengine.google.com/
GOOGLE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your_google_search_api_key_here
GOOGLE_SEARCH_CX=your_search_engine_cx_here

# 3. Brand Name (Used for searching off-site consensus mentions on Reddit, Quora, and Digital PR sites)
BRAND_NAME=your_brand_name_here
